## Conventions

- Lint/format/TS rules are NOT configured here — `tsconfig.json`, `biome.jsonc`,
  `knip.config.ts` and `lint-staged.config.js` are two-line extends of
  `@cleeviox/*` packages. Propose rule changes in the cleeviox-toolkit repo,
  never inline; config updates arrive as dependency bumps.
- Server Components by default; add `'use client'` only where interaction demands it.
- Required environment variables are documented in `.env.example` — keep it in
  sync when adding new ones; never commit real values.
- Scaffolded by `@cleeviox/create-web-template`; framework-level agent guidance
  lives in `AGENTS.md` (generated by create-next-app).
